============================================================
1. SYSTEM PURPOSE
============================================================

The existing manual process is:

1. User needs materials.
2. User writes material name, quantity, location and remarks.
3. User submits/requests material from Store.
4. Store issues available material.
5. In emergency cases, Store may issue material immediately and
   manually write the transaction in a register.
6. Later the user creates a requisition based on the register.
7. Store enters the requisition into Tally as a SALE voucher.
8. Tally inventory is maintained through the Sale Voucher.

The goal is to completely digitize this workflow.

The new system must provide:

USER:
- Simple Flutter Android application
- Add materials quickly
- One daily Master Requisition per user
- Multiple items can be continuously added throughout the day
- Different items can belong to different locations
- User can edit pending items
- Once Store takes action on an item, that item becomes locked

STORE:
- Web-based Store Panel
- View users
- View each user's daily requisition
- View location-wise Sub Requisitions
- Issue full/partial quantities
- Mark item as Not Available
- Edit Store actions until 9 PM
- Handle emergency issues
- View issue history

ADMIN:
- Complete web-based Admin Panel
- Dashboard
- Users
- Locations
- Materials
- Requisitions
- Store actions
- Emergency issues
- Reports
- Tally Export
- Date Override
- Activity Logs
- Settings
- Backup/Restore


