7. MASTER REQUISITION LOGIC
============================================================

CRITICAL BUSINESS RULE:

ONE USER + ONE DATE = ONE MASTER REQUISITION.

Example:

User:
Tapas

Date:
28-Aug-2026

Master Requisition:

REQ-20260828-015

If Tapas adds:

08:15 AM:
Cement - 10 Bag - Location A

11:30 AM:
Phenyl - 5 Ltr - Location B

02:00 PM:
Gloves - 50 Pcs - Location A

06:30 PM:
Pipe - 20 Pcs - Location C

All items belong to:

REQ-20260828-015

There must NOT be four requisitions.

There must be only ONE Master Requisition.


