53. BACKEND TIME VALIDATION
============================================================

Every write operation must validate time on the server.

USER ADD ITEM:

if time < 06:00:
DENY

if time >= 20:00:
DENY


USER EDIT ITEM:

if item has store_action_at:
DENY

if user edit window closed:
DENY


STORE EDIT:

if current time < 21:00:
ALLOW for today's records

else:
check active Admin Date Override

if valid override:
ALLOW

